  "criteria": [
    {"id": "AC1", "text": "When `/v1/version` reports engine revision \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567\" and service revision \"fedcba0987654321fedcba0987654321fedcba09\", `pdd -VV` prints \"PDD CLI: 0.1.29\", \"PDD interpreter: 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567\", \"PDD service: fedcba0987654321fedcba0987654321fedcba09\" and the supported format lines, exiting with code 0."},
    {"id": "AC2", "text": "When `/v1/version` includes `service_sha` as \"unknown\" or a value that is not 40 hexadecimal digits, `pdd -VV` prints \"PDD service: unknown\" without printing raw server text, exiting with code 0."},
    {"id": "AC3", "text": "When `/v1/version` omits `service_sha`, `pdd -VV` omits the \"PDD service:\" line and keeps its existing output, exiting with code 0."}
  ],
